#: admin/MPWEM_Welcome.php:1068
msgid "Global/Common Qty Addon"
msgstr "全局/通用数量插件"

#: admin/MPWEM_Welcome.php:1069
msgid "Global Qty Addon is an excellent solution for managing qty as total available quantity. It's a smart idea that you don't want to manage qty as common qty from this addon useful."
msgstr "Global Qty Addon 是一个出色的解决方案，用于将数量管理为总可用数量。这是一个聪明的想法，您不想像管理此插件中的常见数量一样管理数量。"

#: admin/MPWEM_Welcome.php:1074
msgid "Event Max-Min Quantity Limiting Addon"
msgstr "事件最大-最小数量限制插件"

#: admin/MPWEM_Welcome.php:1075
msgid "This event max-min addon is necessary for limiting the amount of tickets sold. Organizers can set a minimum buying quantity or minimum purchase quantity."
msgstr "此活动 max-min 插件对于限制售票量是必要的。主办方可以设置最低购买数量或最低购买数量。"

#: admin/MPWEM_Welcome.php:1080
msgid "Marketplace / Event Frontend Submit Addon"
msgstr "市场/活动前端提交插件"

#: admin/MPWEM_Welcome.php:1081
msgid "This is a marketplace addon that is needed to allow event submit from frontend, multiple organizer can see ticket. Together in a same website."
msgstr "这是一个市场插件，需要允许从前端提交活动，多个组织者可以看到票证。一起在同一个网站上。"

#: admin/MPWEM_Welcome.php:1086
msgid "WooCommerce Event QR Code Addon"
msgstr "WooCommerce 活动二维码插件"

#: admin/MPWEM_Welcome.php:1087
msgid "QR code addon is necessary for the ticket. If you have a large event then this addon must need to check ticket validity by scanning by QR scanner or mobile."
msgstr "门票需要二维码插件。如果您有大型活动，那么此插件必须需要通过 QR 扫描仪或手机扫描来检查门票的有效性。"

#: admin/MPWEM_Welcome.php:1092
msgid "WooCommerce Event Calendar Addon"
msgstr "WooCommerce 活动日历插件"

#: admin/MPWEM_Welcome.php:1093
msgid "Event Calendar addon is nice addon that can list display in calendar view. Customer can easily understand event date."
msgstr "事件日历插件是一个不错的插件，可以在日历视图中列出显示。客户可以轻松了解活动日期。"

#: admin/MPWEM_Welcome.php:1098
msgid "WooCommerce Event: Book an Event From Dashboard"
msgstr "WooCommerce 活动：从仪表板预订活动"

#: admin/MPWEM_Welcome.php:1099
msgid "This Addon is mainly used for admin, if anyone want to get order offline like phone order then after taking order admin can add attendee from dashboard."
msgstr "该插件主要用于管理员，如果有人想像电话订单一样离线订购，那么在接受订单后管理员可以从仪表板添加与会者。"

#: admin/MPWEM_Welcome.php:1104
msgid "Email Reminder Addon"
msgstr "电子邮件提醒插件"

#: admin/MPWEM_Welcome.php:1105
msgid "This Addon is mainly used for addon, if anyone want to get order offline like phone order then after taking order admin can add attendee from dashboard."
msgstr "该插件主要用于插件，如果有人想像电话订单一样离线订购，那么在接受订单后管理员可以从仪表板添加与会者。"

#: admin/MPWEM_Welcome.php:1110
msgid "Early Bird Ticketing Discount Addon"
msgstr "早鸟票折扣插件"

#: admin/MPWEM_Welcome.php:1111
msgid "Early bird addon is marketing addon, if someone wants to give discount based on date then this addon is very useful."
msgstr "早鸟插件是营销插件，如果有人想根据日期给予折扣，那么这个插件非常有用。"

#: admin/MPWEM_Welcome.php:1116
msgid "WooCommerce Event Waitlist Addon"
msgstr "WooCommerce 活动候补名单插件"

#: admin/MPWEM_Welcome.php:1117
msgid "Waitlist addon is very useful, if any ticket become sold out organizer can get subscription for next available ticket."
msgstr "候补名单插件非常有用，如果任何门票售完，组织者可以订阅下一张可用门票。"

#: admin/MPWEM_Welcome.php:1122
msgid "Event Seat Plan Addon"
msgstr "活动座位计划插件"

#: admin/MPWEM_Welcome.php:1123
msgid "A seat plan addon is needed for that organizer who wants to display a seat plan for customers to choose seat during event ticket buying. Seat plan needed for movie ticket, concert ticket booking."
msgstr "对于想要显示座位计划以供客户在购买活动门票时选择座位的组织者来说，需要一个座位计划插件。电影票、演唱会门票预订需要座位表。"

#: admin/MPWEM_Welcome.php:1128
msgid "Membership Price Addon"
msgstr "会员价格插件"

#: admin/MPWEM_Welcome.php:1129
msgid "Membership pricing addon for the event is needed for that organizer who wants to offer different pricing based on the role. one of a wordpress website."
msgstr "对于想要根据角色提供不同定价的组织者来说，需要该活动的会员定价插件。 WordPress 网站之一。"

#: admin/MPWEM_Welcome.php:1134
msgid "WooCommerce Events: Duplicator Addon"
msgstr "WooCommerce 活动：复制器插件"

#: admin/MPWEM_Welcome.php:1135
msgid "Duplication addon mainly needed to save time while event creating, if you have an existing event then just you can re-create event with all setting needed."
msgstr "复制插件主要需要在创建事件时节省时间，如果您有现有事件，那么您可以使用所需的所有设置重新创建事件。"

#: admin/MPWEM_Welcome.php:1140
msgid "WooCommerce Event Coupon Code Addon"
msgstr "WooCommerce 活动优惠券代码插件"

#: admin/MPWEM_Welcome.php:1141
msgid "Event coupon addon that is used for marketing purpose and giving discount to customer for boosting sell."
msgstr "活动优惠券插件用于营销目的并向客户提供折扣以促进销售。"

#: admin/MPWEM_Welcome.php:1146
msgid "Review and Rating Addon"
msgstr "评论和评级插件"

#: admin/MPWEM_Welcome.php:1147
msgid "It is a feature of adding addon designed to help added offering feedback from customers about their events."
msgstr "这是添加插件的一项功能，旨在帮助添加客户对其活动的反馈。"

#: admin/MPWEM_Welcome.php:1152
msgid "Mage WP Login Page Designer"
msgstr "Mage WP 登录页面设计器"

#: admin/MPWEM_Welcome.php:1153
msgid "This plugin that will design a nice and login panel. It will look more professional than the wordpress default login panel."
msgstr "这个插件将设计一个漂亮的登录面板。它看起来比 WordPress 默认登录面板更专业。"

#: admin/MPWEM_Welcome.php:1162
msgid "Where can I find the Attendee registration Form?"
msgstr "在哪里可以找到与会者登记表？"

#: admin/MPWEM_Welcome.php:1163
msgid "To enable attendee form you must first install a premium addon name “Form Builder”. Once you are done with installing – Click on “Events” -> Click on “All Events” -> Click on Edit of any existing event -> Scroll down below to find \"Attendee Registration Form\""
msgstr "要启用与会者表单，您必须首先安装一个高级插件名称“Form Builder”。安装完成后 – 单击“活动” -> 单击“所有活动” -> 单击编辑任何现有活动 -> 向下滚动以找到“与会者注册表”"

#: admin/MPWEM_Welcome.php:1166
msgid "How can I see event wise registered attendee list?"
msgstr "我如何查看活动的注册与会者列表？"

#: admin/MPWEM_Welcome.php:1167
msgid " If you visit attendee list menu in event section then you will see all attendee list here. You can filter choosing event name and date if event is recurring event."
msgstr " 如果您访问活动部分的与会者列表菜单，那么您将在此处看到所有与会者列表。如果事件是重复事件，您可以过滤选择事件名称和日期。"

#: admin/MPWEM_Welcome.php:1170
msgid "How can I Export attendee list as CSV?"
msgstr "如何将与会者列表导出为 CSV？"

#: admin/MPWEM_Welcome.php:1171
msgid "If you visit attendee list menu in event section then you will see all attendee list here. You can filter choosing event name and date if event is recurring event. After filtering right section there is 2 button to export attendee and extra service."
msgstr "如果您访问活动部分的与会者列表菜单，那么您将在此处看到所有与会者列表。如果事件是重复事件，您可以过滤选择事件名称和日期。过滤右侧部分后，有 2 个按钮用于导出与会者和额外服务。"

#: admin/MPWEM_Welcome.php:1174
msgid "My plugin page shows 404 error?"
msgstr "我的插件页面显示 404 错误？"

#: admin/MPWEM_Welcome.php:1175
msgid "Please re-save the permalink to solve the problem."
msgstr "请重新保存永久链接以解决问题。"

#: admin/MPWEM_Welcome.php:1178
msgid "Where Can I change Event Slug Url?"
msgstr "在哪里可以更改事件 Slug URL？"

#: admin/MPWEM_Welcome.php:1179
msgid "In Event Settings area we have slug changing option. You can change it and resave permalink to avoid 404 error."
msgstr "在“事件设置”区域中，我们有“子弹更换”选项。您可以更改它并重新保存永久链接以避免 404 错误。"

#: admin/MPWEM_Welcome.php:1182
msgid "Where Can I configure Pdf Email?"
msgstr "在哪里可以配置 PDF 电子邮件？"

#: admin/MPWEM_Welcome.php:1183
msgid "If you visit Event settings page then You will see PDF email tab top right, you can configure pdf email here."
msgstr "如果您访问活动设置页面，您将在右上角看到 PDF 电子邮件选项卡，您可以在此处配置 pdf 电子邮件。"

#: admin/MPWEM_Welcome.php:1186
msgid "I have configured correctly but pdf email I am not getting."
msgstr "我已正确配置，但我没有收到 pdf 电子邮件。"

#: admin/MPWEM_Welcome.php:1187
msgid "PDF email with pdf send based on some configuration. If order status processing or complete then only pdf email will send as we considered these 2 order status come after order payment done. If order status holds or pending, then email of pdf will not send."
msgstr "基于某些配置的 PDF 电子邮件和 pdf 发送。如果订单状态正在处理或完成，则只会发送 pdf 电子邮件，因为我们认为这 2 个订单状态是在订单付款完成后出现的。如果订单状态为保留或待处理，则不会发送 pdf 电子邮件。"

#: admin/MPWEM_Welcome.php:1190
msgid "Can I hide any section from event list and details page?"
msgstr "我可以隐藏活动列表和详细信息页面中的任何部分吗？"

#: admin/MPWEM_Welcome.php:1191
msgid "Yes You can hide any section from event list and details page. If you go event settings area in general section, you will find lots of settings regarding all section."
msgstr "是的，您可以隐藏事件列表和详细信息页面中的任何部分。如果您进入常规部分的事件设置区域，您会发现有关所有部分的许多设置。"

#: admin/MPWEM_Welcome.php:1194
msgid "How Can I configure Virtual Event?"
msgstr "如何配置虚拟活动？"

#: admin/MPWEM_Welcome.php:1195
msgid "For virtual event we know there should not have any location or physical address so we recommend to use template virtual that we have during event adding time and also you can use location hide settings from list and details page."
msgstr "对于虚拟事件，我们知道不应该有任何位置或物理地址，因此我们建议使用我们在事件添加期间拥有的虚拟模板，并且您也可以使用列表和详细信息页面中的位置隐藏设置。"

#: admin/MPWEM_Welcome.php:1198
msgid "I installed event manager plugin but it does not work?"
msgstr "我安装了事件管理器插件但它不起作用？"

#: admin/MPWEM_Welcome.php:1199
msgid "Please install WooCommerce plugin first, before installing any plugin."
msgstr "在安装任何插件之前，请先安装 WooCommerce 插件。"

#: admin/MPWEM_Welcome.php:1202
msgid "Do you offer customization?"
msgstr "你们提供定制服务吗？"

#: admin/MPWEM_Welcome.php:1203
msgid "Yes! we offer customization service for our client. If you want any new features don’t hesitate to contact us. Email: magepeopleteam@gmail.com."
msgstr "是的！我们为客户提供定制服务。如果您需要任何新功能，请随时与我们联系。电子邮件：magepeopleteam@gmail.com。"

